\cf5 \cb3 JSON 
\fs22\fsmilli11280 \cb7 null
\fs28 \cb3 . Never impute. Missing counts are taken before the all-null row drop, so\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\fs22\fsmilli11280 \cf5 \cb7 missing_fraction = n_missing / 648
\fs28 \cb3 , not 
\fs22\fsmilli11280 \cb7 / 640
\fs28 \cb3 .\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf5 \cb3 DP3 \'97 All-null row drop. Drop a row only when every feature is null after normalization.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf5 \cb3 Eight injected all-null rows drop; 640 rows are retained. Dropping on any-null instead\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf5 \cb3 of all-null, or dropping before counting missingness, is the classic wrong path.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf5 \cb3 DP4 \'97 Pathway flag derivation. A Sanchez-Vega pathway column is 1 if any mapped gene for\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf5 \cb3 that pathway (per 
\fs22\fsmilli11280 \cb7 pathway_annotation.tsv.gz
\fs28 \cb3 ) is mutated. Using the pre-baked\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\fs22\fsmilli11280 \cf5 \cb7 pathway_*
\fs28 \cb3  columns as-is is correct; re-deriving them from the wrong gene set is not.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf5 \cb3 DP5 \'97 Ranking rule. Top-10 genes and all 10 pathways rank by mutated brain-met count\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf5 \cb3 descending, ties broken by feature name ascending. Ranking by prevalence, by ratio, or\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf5 \cb3 joining top-10 lists on name instead of rank position all diverge from the gold.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf5 \cb3 DP6 \'97 Prevalence-ratio reference and non-finite guard. Prevalence is computed within the\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf5 \cb3 brain-met / no-brain-met strata (denominators 199 and 441). A zero reference prevalence\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf5 \cb3 yields a non-finite ratio and must be stored as JSON 
\fs22\fsmilli11280 \cb7 null
\fs28 \cb3 , not 
\fs22\fsmilli11280 \cb7 0
\fs28 \cb3 , 
\fs22\fsmilli11280 \cb7 inf
\fs28 \cb3 , or a\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf5 \cb3 Haldane-corrected number.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf5 \cb3 DP7 \'97 Univariate logistic estimator. Intercept + one 0/1 feature, IRLS, max 50\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf5 \cb3 iterations:\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf5 \cb3 with z = 1.959963984540054; two-sided p = erfc(|z|/sqrt(2)); BH q within kind. A Firth or\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf5 \cb3 ridge variant, or pooling genes and pathways for BH, lands outside tolerance.\cf0 \cb1 \
